WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.469
When the other students went to bed that night, Wukong stayed awake.

2
00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:12.457
At three o'clock in the morning, he crept quietly through the dark temple.

3
00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:17.168
He entered Subodhi's room.

4
00:00:17.169 --> 00:00:21.361
"Wukong, what are you doing here?" asked the sage.

5
00:00:21.362 --> 00:00:25.152
"I understood your secret message," said the monkey.

6
00:00:25.153 --> 00:00:28.114
"You hit me on the head three times.

7
00:00:28.115 --> 00:00:31.466
That meant you wanted me to visit you at three o'clock.

8
00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:34.478
Now will you teach me how to live forever?"

9
00:00:34.479 --> 00:00:43.306
Subodhi smiled. "I knew you were a worthy student. Come closer."

10
00:00:43.307 --> 00:00:46.738
Subodhi whispered into Wukong's ear.

11
00:00:46.739 --> 00:00:52.631
The sage whispered prayers as well as secret formulas about the universe and nature.

12
00:00:52.632 --> 00:01:00.394
As the monkey listened to his teacher's words, powerful light filled the room.

13
00:01:00.395 --> 00:01:06.740
Now Wukong knew how to live forever!

14
00:01:06.741 --> 00:01:11.994
For the next few years, Wukong meditated and practiced the secret formulas.

15
00:01:11.995 --> 00:01:16.403
While the other students slept at night, Wukong stayed up.

16
00:01:16.404 --> 00:01:23.890
Soon his mind and body were powerful, and he could change shape or size.

17
00:01:23.891 --> 00:01:34.481
He could turn into other animals and soar through the sky on clouds.

18
00:01:34.482 --> 00:01:38.972
One day all the students were sitting outside.

19
00:01:38.973 --> 00:01:43.279
"Wukong," said one student. "You have been busy lately."

20
00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:47.915
"It's true," said another student. "What have you been doing?"

21
00:01:47.916 --> 00:01:52.753
"I've been meditating and practicing secret formulas," said Wukong.

22
00:01:52.754 --> 00:01:56.264
"Secret formulas?" said the first student.

23
00:01:56.265 --> 00:01:59.165
[g@Everyone looked very interested.

24
00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:02.199
They leaned in closer to Wukong.@g]

25
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:07.177
"Yes," said the monkey. "Our master told them to me."

26
00:02:07.178 --> 00:02:11.198
"He did?" said a student. "You must be special.

27
00:02:11.199 --> 00:02:13.788
[g@He doesn't tell everyone those formulas.

28
00:02:13.789 --> 00:02:15.631
What did he teach you?"@g]

29
00:02:15.632 --> 00:02:19.968
Wukong smiled. "He taught me how to live forever.

30
00:02:19.969 --> 00:02:23.899
He also taught me how to change into other things."

31
00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.912
"Show us what you can do," said the student.

32
00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.908
[g@Wukong stood up.

33
00:02:28.909 --> 00:02:32.994
He muttered a quick spell and made a sign with his hands.@g]

34
00:02:32.995 --> 00:02:37.083
Suddenly—[i@zap!@i] The monkey was gone.

35
00:02:37.084 --> 00:02:41.050
An enormous pine tree stood in his place.

36
00:02:41.051 --> 00:02:43.727
[g@Wukong's voice came from the tree.

37
00:02:43.728 --> 00:02:45.479
"What do you think?"@g]

38
00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:48.255
The students clapped and cheered.

39
00:02:48.256 --> 00:02:51.004
"That's amazing!" said one.

40
00:02:51.005 --> 00:02:55.241
"The monkey is truly powerful!" said another.

41
00:02:55.242 --> 00:02:59.828
[g@The noise disturbed Subodhi.

42
00:02:59.829 --> 00:03:04.074
He ran outside and saw the enormous pine tree.@g]

43
00:03:04.075 --> 00:03:07.195
"What's going on out here?" he shouted.

44
00:03:07.196 --> 00:03:09.246
[g@Everyone stopped cheering.

45
00:03:09.247 --> 00:03:12.612
Wukong quickly turned back into himself.@g]

46
00:03:12.613 --> 00:03:15.828
Subodhi's eyes flashed with anger.

47
00:03:15.829 --> 00:03:19.711
"Everyone but Wukong, go inside!" he yelled.

48
00:03:19.712 --> 00:03:27.414
Subodhi waited for the other students to leave.

49
00:03:27.415 --> 00:03:32.056
"I taught you the secret formulas so you could live forever," said the sage.

50
00:03:32.057 --> 00:03:34.704
"Not so you could show off!"

51
00:03:34.705 --> 00:03:38.364
"I'm sorry," said Wukong. "I—"

52
00:03:38.365 --> 00:03:40.370
[g@Subodhi kept talking.

53
00:03:40.371 --> 00:03:43.677
"Now all of the students have seen what you can do.@g]

54
00:03:43.678 --> 00:03:46.278
They will want to know how to do it too!

55
00:03:46.279 --> 00:03:49.837
If you don't tell them, they might harm you.

56
00:03:49.838 --> 00:03:53.599
[g@It's not safe for you to stay here anymore.

57
00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.993
You must go."@g]

58
00:03:55.994 --> 00:03:58.796
[g@Wukong started to cry.

59
00:03:58.797 --> 00:04:01.823
"But, Master! Where will I go?"@g]

60
00:04:01.824 --> 00:04:04.997
"Go back home," said Subodhi.

61
00:04:04.998 --> 00:04:08.581
"But you taught me so many things!" said the monkey.

62
00:04:08.582 --> 00:04:10.835
"I must repay you first."

63
00:04:10.836 --> 00:04:14.274
"You don't need to repay me," said Subodhi.

64
00:04:14.275 --> 00:04:17.043
"Just try to stay out of trouble."

65
00:04:17.044 --> 00:04:22.882
The sage looked at Wukong for a moment.

66
00:04:22.883 --> 00:04:27.474
Then he said, "I can see that you will do evil things someday.

67
00:04:27.475 --> 00:04:31.777
Don't tell anyone you were my student. Now go."

68
00:04:31.778 --> 00:04:38.350
Wukong hung his head. "Good-bye, Master."

69
00:04:38.351 --> 00:04:45.979
He leaped onto a cloud and left.

70
00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:54.097
After a short journey, Wukong arrived at the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

71
00:04:54.098 --> 00:04:59.226
"I have returned!" he called.

72
00:04:59.227 --> 00:05:02.229
[g@The gibbon ran to him.

73
00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:08.725
"Your Majesty! Something terrible has happened!"@g]

